{"quest_id":"quest.main.mq01","stages_ord":0,"ord":0,"id":"answer-roll","text":"text.objective.mq01.answer-roll","complete_when":"quest_objective:quest.main.mq01|0|0:complete_when","objective_text":"In the barge's hold, answer Wuleen-Sei when she reads the blank line (give a name, say nothing or tell her what she can do with it), then follow her up the plank and along the shore path to the fire in the middle of the camp."}
{"quest_id":"quest.main.mq01","stages_ord":1,"ord":0,"id":"choose","text":"text.objective.mq01.choose","complete_when":"quest_objective:quest.main.mq01|1|0:complete_when","objective_text":"Reach one of the two before the fire does: Sal-Sei at the hatching shed at the camp's far end, past the two cutters, or Deesh-Duun in the burning huts, diving under the plank boards to reach her."}
{"quest_id":"quest.main.mq01","stages_ord":2,"ord":0,"id":"cutters","text":"text.objective.mq01.cutters","complete_when":"quest_objective:quest.main.mq01|2|0:complete_when","objective_text":"At the hatching shed, fight off the two cutters or hide in the reeds until they leave, and bring Sal-Sei south through the reeds to the shore below the camp."}
{"quest_id":"quest.main.mq01","stages_ord":3,"ord":0,"id":"out","text":"text.objective.mq01.out","complete_when":"quest_objective:quest.main.mq01|3|0:complete_when","objective_text":"Bring Deesh-Duun out of the burning huts and south through the deep water under the plank boards to the shore below the camp, out of the cutters' sight or past their bodies."}
{"quest_id":"quest.main.mq03","stages_ord":0,"ord":0,"id":"taste","text":"text.objective.mq03.taste","complete_when":"quest_objective:quest.main.mq03|0|0:complete_when","objective_text":"In the hatching shed at the camp's far end, take a phial of the spilled sap, if I know the craft."}
{"quest_id":"quest.main.mq03","stages_ord":0,"ord":1,"id":"token","text":"text.objective.mq03.token","complete_when":"quest_objective:quest.main.mq03|0|1:complete_when","objective_text":"Or dive off the burnt plank boards at the camp's fire, pick the lock of the sunk fish-trap and bring up the courier Mee-Tuja's brass tag."}
{"quest_id":"quest.main.mq03","stages_ord":0,"ord":2,"id":"go","text":"text.objective.mq03.go","complete_when":"quest_objective:quest.main.mq03|0|2:complete_when","objective_text":"Having tasted the sap, and holding the phial or the tag, tell the stranger on the shore I am ready to go."}
{"quest_id":"quest.main.mq03","stages_ord":1,"ord":0,"id":"tell","text":"text.objective.mq03.tell","complete_when":"quest_objective:quest.main.mq03|1|0:complete_when","objective_text":"Tell Nesh-Deeka what I saw at the camp."}
{"quest_id":"quest.main.mq03","stages_ord":1,"ord":1,"id":"ties","text":"text.objective.mq03.ties","complete_when":"quest_objective:quest.main.mq03|1|1:complete_when","objective_text":"Get Ties-The-Loose-Plank to tell the night too: show him the courier's tag, or talk him round."}
{"quest_id":"quest.main.mq03","stages_ord":1,"ord":2,"id":"oath","text":"text.objective.mq03.oath","complete_when":"quest_objective:quest.main.mq03|1|2:complete_when","objective_text":"Take the Reed's oath, or not yet."}
{"quest_id":"quest.main.mq03","stages_ord":2,"ord":0,"id":"door","text":"text.objective.mq03.door","complete_when":"quest_objective:quest.main.mq03|2|0:complete_when","objective_text":"Walk the dream to the door at the top of the ring."}
